<p>Hi <%= @member.name.split.first %>,</p>

<p>
  It's been about a week since your WE Match conversation in <strong><%= @group.name %></strong>
  <% if @partner.present? %>
    with <strong><%= @partner.name %></strong>
  <% end %>.
  We hope it left you with something to carry forward.
</p>

<p>If you have a moment, we'd love a short reflection. It takes under a minute, and it helps us see how these conversations are supporting women to learn from one another.</p>

<p>
  <a href="<%= @feedback_url %>">Share your feedback</a>
</p>

<% if @topic.present? %>
  <p>You were matched to talk about <strong><%= @topic.name %></strong>.</p>
<% end %>

<p>Your answers stay private and are only used as aggregate insight for the WE Community.</p>

<p>— WE Match</p>
